{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X少数地方加入了原叙述没有明确给出的联想，例如“想起童年”“年少时初恋的下午”“让对方安心”，容易把观众带向过于具体的解释。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"平\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X最明显的优势是视觉层级和音乐时间结合得更好：加亮的关键词让人扫一眼就抓住人物此刻的心理转折，小字感受又能在相应乐句出现时补充身体、声音和情绪的细节。尤其从最初不敢表达，到害怕失去，再到接受不确定、决定不再隐藏，前后有连续的心理轨迹；Y的叙述因果其实也很清楚，但感受词较多地停留在并列罗列，观众需要自己把它们组织起来。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4dbb17a8-046b-49e5-bdb6-d32f260d5363", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T011302147392Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.187, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:14:11.351105+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "01727dd7fca9cad35850530aa4bea41306422701a013011462d23f4980c2723d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_atta